@startuml docker-compose
!include ../_theme.puml
title Deployment — docker compose (local / CI)

' Derived from: docker-compose.yml, frontend/frontend/nginx.conf, backend/Dockerfile
left to right direction
actor "Browser" as Browser
node "Docker host" {
  node "frontend\nnginx (SPA)" as fe
  node "gateway\nJRE 17 · :8090" as gw
  node "wovely-backend\ncore · :8081" as core
  node "products\n:8082" as prod
  node "inventory\n:8083" as inv
  database "wp2-project\nmongo:9.0.4" as mongo
  queue "rabbitmq\n4.4.0-management" as mq
  database "redis\n7.4.1" as redis
}
note right of gw
  Host ports: 4200 public;
  8090, 8081-8083, 15672, 27017
  bound to 127.0.0.1 only (tooling)
end note
note bottom of core
  Every service: non-root user,
  /actuator/health healthcheck,
  depends_on: service_healthy
end note

Browser --> fe : http://localhost:4200
fe --> gw : /api, /ws (proxy)
gw --> core
gw --> prod
gw --> inv
gw --> redis
core --> prod : REST
core --> inv : /internal
prod --> inv : /internal
inv --> mq : StockChanged
mq --> prod : consume
core --> mongo
prod --> mongo
inv --> mongo
@enduml
